// The module teaches principles for three kinds of place (a marketplace, a professional network, a local-market job board). It never states a
// platform's current limits, fees, policies or screens, so there are no version notes. Every example person, client and company is fictional.
// The scenarios and message tasks the activities name live in src/features/practice/scenarios/clients/module-05.ts.

